{"unit":2,"items":17,"pass":12,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 2","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 2 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>People around you</h2>\n      <p>Seventeen questions on Lessons 4&ndash;6: countries, family, feelings. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>12 out of 17</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u2\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;12</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She is ___ Brazil.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">of</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">from</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">in</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">I'm ___ from here.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">not</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">no</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ he from Italy? — Yes, he is.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Does</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">This is ___ phone. (Anna)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Anna</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Anna's</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Annas</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">___ name is Marat. (he)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">He's</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Her</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">His</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">___ name is Aliya. (she)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">His</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Her</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">She</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">My mother's mother is my ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sister</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">grandmother</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">aunt</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ you? — I'm fine.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">Are you tired? — Yes, I ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">Are you cold? — No, I'm ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">not</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">no</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">don't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ happy today.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">am</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">My uncle's daughter is my ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">niece</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">sister</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">cousin</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 13&ndash;17</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not. &middot; В письменных ответах важна орфография; заглавные буквы и точки &mdash; нет.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: I am from Paris.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I am not from Paris.|I'm not from Paris.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Rewrite with 's: the car of my father<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"my father's car\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Answer YES: Are you happy?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Yes, I am.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: She am my sister.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She is my sister.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Ask about Anna: … OK?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Is Anna OK?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}